// DEC-033(b): '}' NEWLINE 'else' does not bind to the if — the else falls
// through as a statement and dies as an expression (both compilers; parser
//.astra imposes the same-line rule since DEC-031).
// EXPECT-ERROR: unexpected token in expression
// EXPECT-ERROR-FIRST: 9:5: error: unexpected token in expression
fn main() {
    if true { print(1)
    }
    else { print(2) }
}
